  Text:       `licenses/planegcs-LICENSE.txt`

  HOW IT IS INCORPORATED. planegcs is consumed as an ordinary, unmodified npm
  dependency of `@bunyan/sketch-solver`, loaded at runtime as its own WebAssembly
  module. It is NOT statically linked into Bunyan's kernel module, and this
  repository redistributes no planegcs binary — npm installs it from upstream.
